{
  "id": "desensitization",
  "term": "desensitization",
  "definition": "Desensitization is the reduction of the emotional impact of distressing experiences or responses, such as upsetting memories, pain-related anxiety, or catastrophising about pain. In this context, it means making these reactions less intense so they have less influence on pain and affective symptoms.",
